    <item>
      <title>数千人因洪水失踪，尼泊尔转向集体埋葬</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/30/world/asia/nepal-floods-mass-burials-missing.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[超过 2,500 名失踪人员中只有一小部分死者出现，这突显了一个惨淡的现实：死亡人数可能会在未来几天继续上升。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/30/world/asia/nepal-floods-mass-burials-missing.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 02:47:34 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>山洪暴发后，大峡谷已造成 1 人死亡、15 人可能失踪</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/30/us/grand-canyon-flash-flood-people-missing.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[国家公园管理局表示，周六，洪水摧毁了亚利桑那州光明天使溪附近的人行天桥并损坏了露营地和小屋，至少有 62 人被疏散。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/30/us/grand-canyon-flash-flood-people-missing.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 02:46:36 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>关于尼泊尔和西藏致命山洪的了解</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/26/world/asia/nepal-tibet-floods-wtk.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[即使没有大雨，大规模的山体滑坡和冰川崩塌也可能导致灾难性的洪水。仍有 3,000 多人失踪。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/26/world/asia/nepal-tibet-floods-wtk.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 21:10:04 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>被送往利比里亚的被驱逐者讲述美国移民和海关执法局驱逐和待遇的悲惨细节</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/30/world/africa/us-deportation-flight-ice-detention-liberia.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[十名被驱逐者表示，他们经历或目睹了 ICE 所谓的虐待或暴力待遇。他们说，他们被拘留了几个月，然后被送往与他们没有联系的国家。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/30/world/africa/us-deportation-flight-ice-detention-liberia.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 20:51:35 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
